The native-executable stand-in design was informed by CleanYourTV for LG webOS:
https://github.com/lasharor/cleanyourtv-WebOS
In particular, scripts/home-standin.sh and scripts/jtool.js document the SAM
registration and direct WebAppMgr launch approach. This implementation is
written independently for this launcher, with ES5 runtime and ownership checks.

